// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
// Obfusku Project: a canonical multi-directory Project.
// Demonstrates: obfusku.toml manifest discovery, project-relative
// module resolution (utils/strings.obk is NOT in main.obk's own
// directory — same-directory-only resolution could never reach it),
// and the Project-root filesystem boundary.
//
// Try: obfusku run examples/project
//      obfusku build examples/project
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

⟲ strings

logged ≔ ⌁↑(greeting)
note ≔ ⌁↓⌬("note.txt")

result ≔ greeting
❧
